      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my 18mo is burning up with a fever and i'm freaking out a bit. he's about 11kg. i have the infant motrin (ibuprofen) 100mg/5mL here. i looked at an old chart and it says i should give him about 5mL for his weight, is that roughly correct? i just need to know if i can give him this much so he can sleep.",
